//! TRUST runtime support layer: Rust code generated by the translator
//! depends on this crate at runtime.
//!
//! Design principles: user-visible values stay typst-library's `Value` (no
//! private value model); every semantic helper mirrors the corresponding
//! `typst-eval` interpretation (error messages and span behavior included).

